  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monïngo Yuda kï: Peres nko Esron nko Karmi nko Ur nko Syopal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Syopal kï papoto Reaya, papoto Yaat, papoto Aumai nko Laad, pipö Soratin chete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monïngo Etam kï: Yesrel nko Isma nko Idpas nko cheptangwa Aseleponi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyï Penuel Kedor, kiyï Eser Usya. Chete kï monïngo Ur poretya Eprata papoto Petleem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Asyur nyo kitek kanasyanta Tekoa kor odeny, Ela nko Naara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyichï Naara nyinte monïng angwan: Ausam nko Eper nko Temeni nko Aastari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyichï Ela nyinte monïng sömök: Seret nko Isar nko Etnan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kos kï papoto Anup nko Sopepa nko monïngo Aarel wero Arum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi chi nyo kikïkuro Yapes nyo kikonyïtote kïtïl werkökwa, kïmïnchï kame kaynanoni ompöwölo kilö, “Kingwan nyoman otini kikïyiyöy.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsagh Yapes Tororöt pö Israel kïlenchï, “Soyönante Tororöt aipörogh rotyotïnechan, töpenö nko ani ainategha kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo ipkanïn ghöyityö!” Kutö ECHOTYON nyinte kïgh nyo kisom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pikö walaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Kelup werto ompö Syua werïnyi nyo kikïkuro Meir. Meir kï papoto Eston ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyo kitïng werkachi sömök, Petrapa nko Pasea nko Teina. Teina nyo kitek kanasyanta Naas. Kimang pïchete Reka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Kenas wor odeny: Otniel nko Seraya, kitïng Otniel werko odeny: Atat nko Meonotay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meonotay kï papoto Opra. Seraya kï papoto Yoap nyo kitek mpöghoghyo tekï, wölo kile tïngon pich. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Kalep wero Yepune wor sömök: Iru nko Ela nko Naam, Ela kï papoto Kenas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Yealelel wor angwan: Sip nko Sipa nko Tiria nko Asarel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Esra wor angwan: Yeter nko Mered nko Eper nko Yalon. Kwip Mered Pitia chepö Parao, kïyichï nyinte cheptö nyo kïkuro Miriam nko wor odeny, Syamay nko Ispa. Kitek Ispa kanasyanta Estemoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyiyï korkenyi nyo le chepö Yaudi Yered nyo kitek kanasyanta Kedor nko Eper nyo kitek kanasyanta Soko nko Yekutiel nyo kitek kanasyanta Sanoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kip Odia chepto ompö Naam. Kitek monekwa kanastinechï: pipö Karm, kanasyanta Keila, pipö Maaka kanasyanta Estemoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Syimon wor angwan. Amnon nko Rina nko Penanan nko Tilon. Werpö Isyi kï: Soet nko Pensoet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Monïngo Syela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monïngo Syela wero Yuda kï: Er nyo kitek kanasyanta Leka nko Lada nyo kitek kanasyanta Maresya nko pipö ara pich cho kile tïngon cho kimöngöy kanasyanta Pet Aspea ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko Yokim nko pich cho kimang kanasyanta Kosepa nko Yoas nko Sarap cho kip tipö Moap akïmang Petleem. Ngalechoni kïpö köny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chane cho kile ighi tören cho pö pöytoghin, kimöngöy chane kanastina Netaim nko Kedera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Monïngo Simion",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Simion wor mut: Nemuel nko Yamin nko Yarip nko Sera nko Syaul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Syaul werïnyi nyo kikïkuro Syalum, Mipsam kï wero Syalum, Misma kï wero Mipsam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werpö Misma kï: Amuel nko Sakur nko Syimey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Syimey wor cho le 16 nko tipïn mut nko akonga, wölo kitïng werkökwa monïng cho ngörï, amelö kipöroyit ara Simion le ara Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:27"
          },
